WEBVTT

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.650
Finally, I've caught up with you.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.950
I haven't had such a wonderful Sunday
in so long.

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:10.820
M-Mom!

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.660
F-Fusae...

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.170
You need only say this.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.170
"Fight."

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.920
"And win."

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.010
Then I order you to fight and to win.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.260
And to come back alive.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.700
Am I destined to lose my way?

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.870
All I want is to have fun in my life

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.870
All I want is to be with those I love

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:04.540
Ready or not
Here I come

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:08.210
I don't care anymore

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:11.010
I just don't know anymore

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.550
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.680
There are days when I think like that

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:20.600
But everything is precious to me

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.440
And so I fight on

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:26.940
Today was a tough day

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.030
I almost gave up hope

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:36.120
But the truth is I don't want
to lose anything anymore

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.750
I wish everything would just disappear

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:43.000
There are days when I think like that

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:45.750
But everything is precious to me

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.800
And so I must fight

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:09.480
#33 The Nakamachi trio vs Lady Spider

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:18.030
Oh my, those are your weapons?

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:21.160
I don't believe you can kill me with them.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:25.120
Shut up! I can't stand you
looking like Mom.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:33.420
Die, you imposter!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.640
See? I told you.

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:43.850
Don't hesitate, you idiot.
She's not Fusae.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:47.230
Look closer.
Fusae would never smirk like that.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.150
You're right.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.280
But I'm not sure we stand a chance.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:03:00.160
-Understand? You all will die here.
-Damn it.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:11.420
Now, be good boys and
let me suck your blood.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.680
We need to buy time.
Let's try what Fou said.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:19.680
Okay.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.560
Keep your eyes wide open, you monster.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:33.320
What can you be doing?
What is in that box?

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.820
Welcome, ladies and gentlemen.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.580
What's going on?

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:47.080
Behold, a most strange and wondrous trick.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:54.460
What I have in my hands here
are rocks, real rocks.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.090
I will now eat them,
before your very eyes.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.300
Here I go.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:17.110
I'm going to trust you, Fou.
I'll do what you said.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:23.450
They were originally created
to make the Francine doll laugh.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:28.620
They subconsciously try
to learn new tricks.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:34.300
You don't have to be a shirogane
to attack them then.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.670
Right, Nakamachi Circus?

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.300
How about it?

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:48.140
No rounds of applause yet?

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.440
Then I'll just keep eating some more.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:58.990
The explosives Fou prepared for us.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.990
We can detonate them using this remote.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.870
So, what's the plan?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:15.630
How's that? Can I have some appreciation?

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:20.630
Oh dear. I'm already bored.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:24.390
Pops!

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.220
I'll go next.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.890
Pops, help me out.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.140
What now?

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:36.570
Okay, girls and boys,
here's the next trick.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:42.280
It's time for Hiroo Nakamachi's
acrobatic show.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:46.660
There!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:51.710
Humph!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:05.470
There should be a lever here
to disconnect the cars.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:06.720
There it is.

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:15.900
Dang it, it's pretty low down there.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.190
Careful now.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.330
Something's not right. I'll go check.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:38.790
What...?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.090
Hey big guy, what's up?

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.420
Is that you, Mr. Nakamachi?

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.550
I was wondering if something was up.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.220
Hey, open the door. What's going on?

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.850
Nothing.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:57.100
Nori got motion sickness
and he's throwing up all over the place.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:07:01.230
He's crying and
doesn't want Shirogane to see.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:05.110
He's as filthy as heck
with vomit all over his face.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.450
Jeez, Pops.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:08.870
Is he okay?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:14.410
Yeah, no problemo.
You go back and be with Shirogane.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.620
Okay.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.840
There.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.730
Dammit, it won't budge.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:37.900
There!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.070
I've seen enough.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.990
Hiro! Nori, I'll leave it to you.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:55.500
God dammit!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.420
Yes! One more thing.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:04.920
Can't forget this.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:10.300
Forgive us, Masaru.
This is the best we can do.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:20.230
Oh dear. You've already had your turns.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:23.150
Don't waste my time with the same tricks.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:29.950
I must kill you and then
go kill Éléonore and Narumi.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.490
You monster puppet with Mom's face.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.950
Ever heard these words?

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:38.290
What words?

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:43.960
Those who get in the way of lovers
should be kicked by a horse.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.880
We won't let you bother
Shirogane and Narumi.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.380
What nonsense.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:51.720
All right, do your job.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.260
Just you watch, you damned puppet.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.100
Go!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:02.270
Hiro, Pops, let's do this.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.410
What's going on?

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:20.080
Come on, you spider woman.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.010
Nice try, boys.

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:38.390
But poor you. I'm not going to fall.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.390
Dammit.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:43.520
This train will collapse any time now.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.860
And you'll be crushed flat.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:51.200
No, she has to fall or we lose.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.450
Come down, you coward!

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.790
As if I would.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.910
You bastard!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.080
Nori's special ladder climb!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.590
Hey, you imposter.

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:11.550
-Bro!
-Nori!

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.470
Take this!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.050
Let go of me!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:29.190
Why waste your life like this?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.400
Humans are all going to die anyway.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:35.910
Our real Mom said to us.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.030
The circus...

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:40.490
must never...

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.830
stop the show...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:48.840
Our sons saw it through to the end.

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.340
Right, Fusae?

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:16.070
That was one heck of a show.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:20.700
But the train is still running.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.660
I swear on a duck's butt,

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:28.380
we gotta go demolish
the space shuttle that's on it.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.920
We will not let you.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:35.220
Lady Francine does not wish it.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:41.100
These two think they can beat us.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.560
What fools.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:46.640
I will crush those thoughts
along with their heads.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:50.940
Interesting. Let's see you try.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:56.200
Oh my, they're already at it.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:00.280
So how about it,
Mr. Serious Face Pantalone?

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:04.540
I take it you're all jest
and never serious.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.250
Of course.

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:09.830
It's so lame to get serious
over something.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.500
You can't beat me.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:37.280
I've mastered all forms
of human martial arts.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:43.870
My pride and joy is in using it
to defeat my foes.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.910
I know. So this is how I will fight you.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:54.710
You fool. I told you at Mont Saint-Michel
that your flames are nothing to me.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:02.220
Yes, but there was a human girl
by my side then.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:07.350
But now, there is nothing to hold me back.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:15.650
Behold, the master musician
of the Midnight Circus.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.780
Scherzo, Benedicamus Domino.
Let us bless the Lord.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.960
He's sending out sound as shock waves.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.010
He had such a trick?

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:42.840
Brighella. Let me tell you the weak point
of your martial arts.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.600
It is that you can't beat
those you can't reach.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:48.680
Prepare to die.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.940
Give it up. You can't escape
from the sound waves of my lute.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:12.000
I didn't want to resort to this trick
when I fought Narumi.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.130
You bastard...

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.250
But I must defeat you.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.550
You bastard...

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:22.630
Farewell, Brighella!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.430
You bastard...!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:42.860
I didn't want to use
such asinine contraptions.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.160
Brighella, you...

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:52.910
Which is why I kept them hidden away
and pursued martial arts.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.500
You will pay for this, Arlequino.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:05.260
One, two, three. One, two, three.
Peek-a-boo.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.260
You still play the fool?

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.100
Of course.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:15.100
I swear on the chilly Siberian wind,
getting all worked up is just so lame.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.820
By the way, this is what's cool.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.200
See? One shot is enough
for the antique puppet.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.830
I bet you don't know what hit you.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:35.040
This power that Lord Faceless gave me...

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.410
I know.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.920
Weather control technology.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:44.340
You can control the weather
any way you like.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.970
Correct!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.640
So, Mr. Know-it-all.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:53.850
Guess what my dream is?

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.230
What are you talking about?

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:03.400
To tell you the truth, it has to do
with the one you antiques revere.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.740
I'm in love with Doll Francine.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.160
What?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:18.460
You antiques made her into works of art,
mimicking humans.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.920
As I gazed at those artworks...

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:29.930
The gears in my brains began to turn
in such a sweet seductive way.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.430
And I realized what it was.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.060
The thing humans call "love."

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:45.360
But Doll Francine was long gone by then.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.990
Lord Faceless told me so.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.620
I was so depressed.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.450
But guess what!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.620
She was still here on Earth after all.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:00.870
Éléonore...

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.380
Yeah, you can call her that too.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.250
I was so happy.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.840
I heard she was the reincarnation
of Doll Francine.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:16.140
Ever since that day,
I've had dreams just like humans do.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:20.390
Shirogane, a circus entertainer.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:24.150
In my dreams,
I jest with her for eternity.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:29.150
But Francine was Lord Faceless's girl.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:32.910
So I'd given up.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:37.540
But for whatever reason,

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.460
Lord Faceless is up in space alone.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.670
And Francine is in that train.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:48.550
That means I can have her, right?
I can have Francine, can't I?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.340
Something must've happened.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:55.470
And Lord Faceless
doesn't want Francine anymore.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:18:01.690
So Francine and I are going to
put on comedies for eternity.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.190
In a world without humans.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:09.820
So, Pantalone. I need to hurry up
and crush you to bits.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:15.450
And catch that train with the woman
you pledged your loyalty to.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.330
And make her mine.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:32.840
What? Did I say something funny?

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:37.430
We, Les Quatre Pionniers.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:42.020
We tried forever
to make Lady Francine laugh.

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:48.610
But she never did. Not even a smile.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:52.610
And I understand now.

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:58.160
It's because I had never laughed myself.
Not even once.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.040
Thanks, Harlequin.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:05.670
You let me realize that.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.960
Come again?

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:13.970
I'm saying that you're quite a jester.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:28.980
You think you fell in love
just by looking at her? Love, you say?

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:32.030
An automaton, in love!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:40.530
Comedy in a world where
there's nobody left to laugh?

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.500
Pantalone.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.130
I'm going to break you.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:54.130
-That's what you call...
-Shut up.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.130
A real joke.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:00.180
Shut up, Pantalone!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.770
You fool, Harlequin.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:10.900
No matter what happens,
that lady will never be yours.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:12.320
Why!

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:15.070
Because I heard her.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.700
I am your Shirogane.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:29.210
She's already decided for herself
who owns her.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.670
Too bad!

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:36.630
Shut up!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.180
Shut up, shut up, Pantalone!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.640
Francine is mine, I will make her mine!

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.680
Stop laughing!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:50.480
She's not Lady Francine, Harlequin.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.730
That lady.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.240
She is not Lady Francine.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.450
Shut up!

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:04.410
Oh? I thought you never got serious.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:30.270
Something's definitely up.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.980
What's that smoke?

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:40.780
Something has happened.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:44.780
The rear cars are gone.

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:53.670
Francine, I've finally caught up with you.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:55.710
-Who are you?
-Harlequin!

00:21:58.300 --> 00:21:59.340
Let's do this.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.590
-Stop, Kato. Stand back.
-Move.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:04.090
I'm the one who will protect you.

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:25.200
A past that can't become a memory
plays on repeat

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:30.120
In my mind is a forgotten thing
that I still remember

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:34.790
Questions remain unanswered
but I must go now

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:39.670
I walk in the dark,
making a promise to my footprints

00:22:39.840 --> 00:22:44.340
So many similar beings
leading similar lives

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:49.060
Was there a reason
for me to be born at all?

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:53.810
The world lost all sound
but for the ticking of a clock

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:58.650
A missing heart keeps shouting

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:03.440
A meaningless life was shaking

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:08.160
All because of your unique existence

00:23:08.370 --> 00:23:12.790
If the reason for the pain
is revealed someday

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:17.540
If you find a home
for those tears someday

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:22.630
You shall sleep
with the whole universe in your arms

00:23:22.800 --> 00:23:30.510
I know it still plays in your heart

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:34.520
The melody that brought you here
